本媒体 PIVOT 专访时表示，今天是比历史上任何一天都更适合创业的日子，AI、区块链和互联网这几个大方向非常清楚，只要找到大家需要、自己又能做出来的东西，成功的机会相当大。\n\nCZ https://t.co/AcWN5Kpi0O","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2114638663858692217"},{"author_id":"5709522","created_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114638604978827370"],"id":"2114638604978827370","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":12245,"like_count":25,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这两年，网文和剧，三妻四妾的现象少了。男性作者也不怎么敢这么写了，大量的作品，都是一生一世爱一人。","url":"https://x.com/mranti/status/2114638604978827370"},{"author_id":"1050570534860156928","created_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114638533503996208"],"id":"2114638533503996208","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":5710,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":1},"text":"小编最近在逛 NEAR 的 Github 时发现了一个有趣的东西：\n\nNEAR AI 团队开源了一项测试，他们用中国开源大模型 DeepSeek，成功解出了672道极具难度的数学证明题。\n\n问了一下AI发现，这些题目叫做 PutnamBench，是北美最顶级的大学生数学竞赛题。\n\n简单来说，能通关这个测试，说明 AI https://t.co/QcCZhcJ61x","url":"https://x.com/TechFlowPost/status/2114638533503996208"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T08:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114638160793928073"],"id":"2114638160793928073","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":36,"impression_count":44715,"like_count":255,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":17},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112750724115304472","type":"quoted"}],"text":"懂车帝两年多前质疑华为问界M7油管靠前，钻撞或柱碰易断裂起火，网友：“他到底看了多远”\n\n近日，懂车帝2024年分析山西运城问界M7事故的视频被网友翻出。\n主持人当时指着发动机舱表示，油管位置“还比较靠前”，车辆钻撞卡车后“可能把它这个油管挤爆了”。\n\n网友留言：\n“他到底看了多远” https://t.co/ULrW7Y6Nxj https://t.co/mn3BQmRUlX","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114638160793928073"},{"author_id":"791197","created_at":"2026-10-26T08:37:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114637561536872549"],"id":"2114637561536872549","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":17870,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text"